WEBVTT

open
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Your agent made a picture. Nobody kept the recipe.

title
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.600
SlopCamera. A media studio your coding agent runs.

step-1
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.000
Ask. Your agent writes a short source file and renders it.

step-2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.400
Get every version. Light, dark and editable files, all from that one source.

step-3
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.800
Change one label. Edit one line of the source and render again. Nothing is redrawn by hand.

step-4
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.700
Cut every shape. One edit gives landscape, square and portrait video.

proof
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.200
47 examples, each with its source. 5 files from one diagram source. 4 video shapes from one edit

limits
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.200
What it does not do. It does not judge the result. A person still looks at every render.

end
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.700
SlopCamera. slopcamera.com. Open source, MIT licensed.
